  "solution": "**Calculations:**\n\nAccording to the question,\n\nLet the difference be 'x'.\n\nx = [12/(13/14)] - [(12/13)/14]\n\n⇒ x = [(12 × 14)/13] - [12/(13 × 14)]\n\n⇒ x = [168/13] - [6/91]\n\n⇒ x = [(168 × 7) - 6]/91\n\n⇒ x = (1176 - 6)/91\n\n⇒ x = 1170/91 = 12.85 or 12(6)/(7).\n\n**∴ The difference will be 12.85 or 12(6)/(7)**.",
